// A topic attached to a whole faction: every Traders Guild member offers it, whoever they are,
// once their greeting ends. This is how a mod - and later a quest - gives the base game's people
// something new to talk about without editing them.
//
// Compile with: ysc compile guild.yarn -o . -n guild

title: GuildTopic
kind: Topic
attach: Speaker.Faction == TradersGuild
label: Who runs the Traders Guild?
---
Trader: Whoever holds the most debt. This year, that isn't me. #line:guild_debt
-> Who, then? #line:guild_who
    Trader: Ask the next caravan master you meet. Bring coin; they charge for answers. #line:guild_caravan
-> Sounds like a hard way to live. #line:guild_hard
    Trader: It's a living. The hard part is the road. #line:guild_road
===
